10:10.740 --> 10:22.940
Imagine N number of parties, say 100 different hospitals, and they want to compute a shared function over their patient data to find out if a disease is spreading. Traditionally, how would we do that?

10:23.300 --> 10:30.400
Well, we'd set up highly encrypted secure pipelines between all the hospitals and a central trusted server. We'd lock down the pipeline.

10:30.400 --> 10:34.420
Right. But the RRE model says, well, what if we don't use secure pipelines at all?

10:34.720 --> 10:39.020
