Think about the spaces we defined earlier.

13:12.040 --> 13:27.820
Right. The trajectory space, X, has 8 possible configurations for 3 people. Maybe only Alice has it. Maybe Alice and Bob. Maybe all 3. But the admissible manifold, M, only has 2 states baseline 0, or uniform randomness.

